.SH DESCRIPTION
.B opencode
is an open source AI coding agent that helps you write code in your terminal,
desktop, or IDE. It supports 75+ LLM providers, LSP integration, multi-session
workflows, custom agents, MCP tools, and GitHub Actions automation.
.P
Run without arguments to start the interactive Terminal User Interface (TUI)
in the current directory. Pass a project path to start in a specific directory.
.SH TUI (TERMINAL USER INTERFACE)
When launched without a command,
.B opencode
opens a full-screen TUI where you can converse with AI models, reference files
via \(lq@\(rq, run shell commands via \(lq!\(rq, and use slash commands.
.SS File References
Use
.B @
followed by a filename to fuzzy-search and attach file contents to your prompt.
.SS Shell Commands
Start a message with
.B !
to execute a shell command. The output is added to the conversation.
.SS Slash Commands
The TUI supports the following built-in slash commands:
.TP
.B /connect
Add or configure an AI provider.
.TP
.B /init
Scans the project and creates or updates
.BR AGENTS.md .
.TP
.B /undo
Undo the last message and revert all file changes (requires Git).
.TP
.B /redo
Redo a previously undone message (requires Git).
.TP
.B /new
Start a new session. Alias:
.BR /clear .
.TP
.B /compact
Summarize and compact the current session to reduce context. Alias:
.BR /summarize .
.TP
.B /sessions
List and switch between sessions. Aliases:
.BR /resume ", " /continue .
.TP
.B /share
Create a shareable link to the current conversation.
.TP
.B /unshare
Remove sharing from the current session.
.TP
.B /export
Export the conversation as Markdown and open in your editor.
.TP
.B /editor
Open an external editor to compose your message.
.TP
.B /models
List available models from configured providers.
.TP
.B /themes
List and switch between UI themes.
.TP
.B /thinking
Toggle visibility of model reasoning/thinking blocks.
.TP
.B /details
Toggle tool execution details in the output.
.TP
.B /help
Display the help dialog.
.TP
.B /exit
Exit OpenCode. Aliases:
.BR /quit ", " /q .
.SS Keybinds
Default keyboard shortcuts (configurable via
.BR tui.json ):
.TP
.B Tab
Switch between primary agents (Build \(hA Plan).
.TP
.B Ctrl+P
Open command palette.
.TP
.B Ctrl+T
Cycle through model variants.
.TP
.B Ctrl+X
Leader key prefix (followed by a command key).
.TP
.B Ctrl+X u
Undo.
.TP
.B Ctrl+X r
Redo.
.TP
.B Ctrl+X c
Compact session.
.TP
.B Ctrl+X n
New session.
.TP
.B Ctrl+X l
Sessions list.
.TP
.B Ctrl+X e
External editor.
.TP
.B Ctrl+X x
Export conversation.
.TP
.B Ctrl+X m
List models.
.TP
.B Ctrl+X t
Themes.
.TP
.B Ctrl+X q
Exit.
